   "evidence": "Line 223 has `\u27e8torusFamilyFixedFiberQuotientMap \u2026 x, (range_\u2026 ) \u25b8 Set.mem_range_self x\u27e9` on the LHS, and its proof is just `.symm_apply_apply x`. `coe_torusFamilyFixedFiberQuotientHomeomorph` only rewrites `(e x).1` in the forward direction.",
