   "fix": "Add a `@[simp]` lemma `torusFamilyFixedFiberQuotientMap_homeomorph_symm_apply (z) : torusFamilyFixedFiberQuotientMap \u2026 ((torusFamilyFixedFiberQuotientHomeomorph \u2026).symm z) = z`. Optionally also add a version for `z = Quotient.mk _ w` with `hw : torusFamilyProjection P w = y`. Drop or demote the cast-based lemma.",
   "issue": "`torusFamilyFixedFiberQuotientHomeomorph_symm_apply` is `symm_apply_apply` restated with a subtype literal whose membership proof is built with a `\u25b8` cast. Simp only matches that exact shape, and for a general `z : Quotient.mk _ '' {z | torusFamilyProjection P z = y}` there is no lemma giving `torusFamilyFixedFiberQuotientMap (e.symm z) = \u2191z`, so the advertised inverse formula is missing in usable form.",
   "line": 223
  }
